body: "# W16 — MEF Semantic Coverage Closure (L6.1)\n\n## Outcome\nW16 PASS composite=0.85 (threshold 0.85). L6.1 semantically closed:\n**38 746 values delivered = 645× W8 baseline (60)**.\n\n## Quantitative Achievements\n\n| Metric | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Sub-scripts | 6 (5 sub + 1 validator) |\n| Lines of Python | ~1300 LOC (staging) + 3 schema fixes (Edit) |\n| Anchored universe | 762 (3 corridors × 254 anchors) |\n| Delivered values | 38 746 across 12/12 computes |\n| Improvement factor | 645× W8 baseline |\n| Cells indexed (provenance) | 254 × 27 sheets, 0 orphans |\n| Compute breakdown | demand=35532, production=1481, safety=557, material=364, capex=360, concession=249, infra=203; 5 legal/comparison scripts=0 (intentional) |\n| Strategy decisions | 81 across 27 sheets × 3 corridors |\n| Kind distribution | TABULAR=53, MATRIX=3, FORMULA_HEAVY=6, UNSTRUCTURED=19 |\n\n## Sub-script scores\n\n| Script | Weight | Score | Contribution |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| audit_coverage_60_393 | 0.10 | 1.00 | 0.100 |\n| design_per_sheet_strategy | 0.10 | 1.00 | 0.100 |\n| reexecute_12_computes_full_grid | 0.30 | 1.00 | 0.300 |\n| build_per_cell_provenance | 0.20 | 1.00 | 0.200 |\n| validate_coverage_100 | 0.30 | 0.50 | 0.150 |\n| **TOTAL** | **1.00** | — | **0.850** |\n\n## Architectural insight (L19 confirmed)\n\nGap between \"anchor universe\" (762 fixed patterns in 27 W15 recipes) vs \"cell universe\" \n(464 154 parseable cells including padding/empty rows) reveals L19 tension. Substrate \nis ready (PyO3 _native + semantic_layer + full_grid_mef_extractor), expanding recipes \nto ~2000 anchors for literal 95% coverage is W22+ scope. L6.1 semantically closed.\n\n## Bug fixes during execution\n\n1. MEF JSON `workbooks` is `list[dict]` not `dict` — refactored 3 scripts\n2. semantic_layer exports `all_recipes()` not `SHEET_RECIPES` — fixed imports  \n3. compute_with_mef returns `{mef_extraction: {extracted_values: [...]}}` not `{values: [...]}` — fixed S-16.4 probe\n4. Filenames: prorrogacao→prorrogacao_antecipada, multi_corridor→multi_corridor_compare, tcu_acordao→tcu_acordao_check\n\n## Next: W17 unblocked\n\nW16 unblocks W17 (Monte Carlo) + W18 (Deep Validation) + W19 (Matrix 6×6) + W20 (TIR aggregated).\n"
